"<p>All endpoints below are relative to <code>https://&#x3C;your-panel>/api/v1</code> and require <code>Authorization: Bearer nbk_...</code>. Every endpoint is also automatically exposed as an MCP tool (except SSE streaming).</p>\n<h2>Servers &#x26; Monitoring</h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th align=\"left\">Method</th><th align=\"left\">Path</th><th align=\"left\">Permission</th><th align=\"left\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/servers</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>server.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">List the team's servers.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/servers/{serverId}</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>server.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">Get details for one server.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/servers/{serverId}/health</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>server.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">Latest health snapshot (CPU, memory, disk, load), app/database counts, and alert thresholds.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/servers/{serverId}/metrics/{range}</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>monitoring.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">Binned metric history over <code>range</code> (<code>1h</code>, <code>24h</code>, or <code>7d</code>).</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Templates</h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th align=\"left\">Method</th><th align=\"left\">Path</th><th align=\"left\">Permission</th><th align=\"left\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/templates</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">List deployable templates, editable inputs, requirements, and <code>advanced</code> flags.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/templates/{templateId}/versions</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">List stable versions and <code>defaultRef</code> for a template.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Apps</h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th align=\"left\">Method</th><th align=\"left\">Path</th><th align=\"left\">Permission</th><th align=\"left\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">List the team's apps.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>POST</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps/preflight</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.deploy</code></td><td align=\"left\">Read-only pre-flight check for a new marketplace app (<code>{ ok, checks }</code>).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>POST</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.deploy</code></td><td align=\"left\">Create and deploy a marketplace template app (runs pre-flight first; returns <code>{ appId, deploymentId }</code>).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps/{appId}</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">Get app overview (domains, services; secrets masked).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps/{appId}/env</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">Get <code>.env</code> text and variable metadata with all secret values masked.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>POST</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps/{appId}/logs</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">Read the last <code>tail</code> container log lines (optionally filtered by <code>service</code> and <code>timestamps</code>), with secrets masked.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps/{appId}/deployments</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">List the app's last 50 deployments (newest first).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>POST</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps/{appId}/deploy</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.deploy</code></td><td align=\"left\">Without <code>version</code>: redeploy pinned commit. With <code>version</code>: update to it (optional <code>backupFirst</code>, <code>confirmDowngrade</code>).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>POST</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps/{appId}/redeploy</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.deploy</code></td><td align=\"left\">Redeploy the app at its pinned commit.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>POST</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps/{appId}/start</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.deploy</code></td><td align=\"left\">Start the stopped app, or one <code>service</code> (<code>{ service? }</code>).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>POST</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps/{appId}/stop</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.deploy</code></td><td align=\"left\">Stop the app (data kept), or one <code>service</code> (<code>{ service? }</code>).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>POST</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps/{appId}/restart</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>app.deploy</code></td><td align=\"left\">Restart the app, or one <code>service</code> (<code>{ service? }</code>).</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Backups &#x26; Jobs</h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th align=\"left\">Method</th><th align=\"left\">Path</th><th align=\"left\">Permission</th><th align=\"left\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps/{appId}/backups</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>backup.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">List an app's backups (newest first).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>POST</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/apps/{appId}/backups</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>backup.create</code></td><td align=\"left\">Start an immediate backup (<code>{ destinationId? }</code>; defaults to schedule's destination).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/backups/destinations</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>backup.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">List team backup destinations (<code>{ id, name, type }</code>, no credentials).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/jobs</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>server.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">List recent team jobs (deploys, backups, server actions).</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/jobs/{jobId}</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>server.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">Get status and details of a single job.</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>GET</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>/jobs/{jobId}/stream</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>server.view</code></td><td align=\"left\">Stream live job logs via Server-Sent Events (SSE).</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Example Requests</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># List apps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Authorization: Bearer </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$TOKEN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://panel.example.com/api/v1/apps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Trigger a redeploy (returns { \"deploymentId\": \"...\" })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> POST</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Authorization: Bearer </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$TOKEN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  https://panel.example.com/api/v1/apps/</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">appI</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/redeploy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Read last 100 masked log lines</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> POST</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Authorization: Bearer </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$TOKEN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Content-Type: application/json\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{\"tail\": 100}'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  https://panel.example.com/api/v1/apps/</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">appI</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/logs</span></span></code></pre>"